 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Use the statements, <span data-math=\"p\">p</span>: Elvis Presley wore capes and <span data-math=\"q\">q</span>: Some superheroes wear capes, to write the following statements:",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 497452,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Write the conditional statement, <span data-math=\"p \\to q\">p \\to q</span>, in words.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Elvis Presley wore capes.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Some superheroes wear capes.</p>\n<p>The symbol is the conditional and is translated “if…then…” or “implies.”</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"p\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\rightarrow\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"q\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>If</td>\n<td>Elvis Presley wore capes,</td>\n<td>then</td>\n<td>some superheroes wear capes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>If Elvis Presley wore capes, then some superheroes wear capes.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 497453,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Write the converse statement, <span data-math=\"q \\to p\">q \\to p</span>, in words.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Elvis Presley wore capes.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Some superheroes wear capes.</p>\n<p>The converse of <span data-math=\"p \\rightarrow q\"></span> is <span data-math=\"q \\rightarrow p\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The symbol is the conditional and is translated “if…then…” or “implies.”</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\rightarrow\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"p\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>If</td>\n<td>some superheroes wear capes,</td>\n<td>then</td>\n<td>Elvis Presley wore capes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>If some superheroes wear capes, then Elvis Presley wore capes.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 497454,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Write the inverse statement, <span data-math=\"\\text{~}p \\to {\\rm{ }}\\text{~}q\">\\text{~}p \\to {\\rm{ }}\\text{~}q</span>, in words.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Elvis Presley wore capes.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Some superheroes wear capes.</p>\n<p>The inverse of <span data-math=\"p \\rightarrow q\"></span> is <span data-math=\"{\\sim}p \\rightarrow {\\sim}q\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The symbol is the conditional and is translated “if…then…” or “implies.”</p>\n<p>The negation symbol <span data-math=\"({\\sim})\"></span> is translated “not.”</p>\n<p>A “some…” statement is negated with “no….”\n</p><table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\sim}p\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\rightarrow\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\sim}q\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>If</td>\n<td>Elvis Presley did not wear capes,</td>\n<td>then</td>\n<td>no superheroes wear capes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>If Elvis Presley did not wear capes, then no superheroes wear capes.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 497455,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Write the contrapositive statement, <span data-math=\"\\text{~}q \\to {\\rm{ }}\\text{~}p\">\\text{~}q \\to {\\rm{ }}\\text{~}p</span>, in words.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Elvis Presley wore capes.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Some superheroes wear capes.</p>\n<p>The contrapositive of <span data-math=\"p \\rightarrow q\"></span> is <span data-math=\"{\\sim}q \\rightarrow {\\sim}p\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The symbol is the conditional and is translated “if…then…” or “implies.”</p>\n<p>The negation symbol <span data-math=\"({\\sim})\"></span> is translated “not.”</p>\n<p>A “some…” statement is negated with “no….”\n</p><table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"–q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\rightarrow\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"–p\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>If</td>\n<td>no superheroes wear capes,</td>\n<td>then</td>\n<td>Elvis Presley did not wear capes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>If no superheroes wear capes, then Elvis Presley did not wear capes.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
